{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09462","headline":"贵游行 · 韦应物","name":"贵游行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉帝外家子，恩泽少封侯。\n垂杨拂白马，晓日上青楼。\n上有颜如玉，高情世无俦。\n轻裾含碧烟，窈窕似云浮。\n良时无还景，促节爲我讴。\n忽闻艳阳曲，四坐亦已柔。\n宾友仰称叹，一生何所求。\n平明击锺食，入夜乐未休。\n风雨愆岁候，兵戎横九州。\n焉知坐上客，草草心所忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}